han a test failure.\n\nThis points to a stale failure classification or a post-generation publication/status handoff failure rather than a remaining Gradle test failure.\n\nInspect:\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T05-24-36-243697Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T10-56-07-651184Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T11-01-40-136852Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/finalization/generateLibraryStats-2026-10-07T11-20-19-008270Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Review the preserved 10-test suite and confirm the earlier Spring Test AOT-dependent variant is no longer present.\n2. Clean the coordinate’s outputs and rerun the complete coordinate test and validation lanes to confirm the preserved tree remains green.\n3. If those checks pass, regenerate or repair the publication handoff and metrics status instead of treating this as an unresolved test-generation failure.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0aae1c8da5179779016ac62e2c28b887d1bb73a62041232ddd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 16331, "output": 2116, "cacheRead": 246528, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1552, "totalTokens": 264975, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791372806820, "responseId": "resp_0aae1c8da5179779016ac62e07b6e887d18e07e66828bb7f21", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
